TrailHuts data license
=======================

Everything under data/ (shelter records, the merged GeoJSON built from
them, and any OSM-derived candidate lists) is made available under the
Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0:

    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/

Any rights in the individual contents of the database (e.g. free-text
`notes` or `access_notes` fields) are licensed under the Database Contents
License (DbCL) v1.0:

    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1.0/

Why ODbL: much of this dataset is cross-checked against, and in places
derived from, OpenStreetMap data, which is itself ODbL-licensed. Rather than
maintaining two parallel licenses for "our" records vs OSM-derived ones,
the whole data/ directory is ODbL so the combined/merged database produced
by scripts/build_geojson.py stays open under one consistent license,
matching ODbL's share-alike intent.

Attribution
-----------

If you reuse this data, you must:

1. Attribute TrailHuts (https://trailhuts.ie) and OpenStreetMap
   contributors (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright) wherever the
   data or a produced work (e.g. a map) is publicly used.
2. Keep any derivative database you publish under ODbL as well (share-alike).

This notice mirrors the approach OpenStreetMap itself uses for its own
copyright/license page.
